        <activityName xml:lang="en">Horse dung and waste wood chips, burned in grate furnace 500-600kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Horse dung and waste wood chips, burned in grate furnace 500-600kW
Air emission data completed with the inventory of wood chips, from forest, mixed, burned in furnace 1000kW;
UUID: e5bfb8f0-b26f-3fd8-87d9-1025d5a66fd5
This data set includes fuel, infrastructure, ash disposal and air emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: grate firing 500-600 kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e5bfb8f0-b26f-3fd8-87d9-1025d5a66fd5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
